{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4902200410010","name":"甘奈","text":"……\r\n負けちゃった～……","trans":"……\n输掉了～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そんなに美味しそうなのか？　俺","trans":"有那么好吃吗？　我","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……わかった\r\nじゃあひと口だけ、かじっていいぞ","trans":"……知道了\n那，只准咬一口哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200410040","name":"甘奈","text":"……！\r\nありがと……！","trans":"……！\n谢啦……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200410050","name":"甘奈","text":"いただきます……\r\n……ごちそうさま……","trans":"我开动了……\n……多谢款待……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……おお、本当にひと口なんだな……","trans":"……哦哦，真的只一口啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200410060","name":"甘奈","text":"だって……\r\nこれ以上は理性が……ね……","trans":"因为……\n再这样下去理性就……呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200410070","name":"甘奈","text":"飛んじゃっても……いいの……？","trans":"就算飞走了……也可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}